User Experience Feedback:
- Some users felt anxious about locking their apps worried they may not unlock
- Instructions need to be very clear, some reported not being certain which apps were
  selected after choosing them
- The provided scanlock could be better than just a png (perhaps other formats would be nice)
- Sometimes users want to take a quick break (maybe add a 5 minute unlock break that works a few times a day?)

